graph TD
    %% Phase 1 Ingestion
    A[Curated SCOTUS Cases / Synthetic Supplement] --> B{is_curated check}
    B -- Curated: Always Include --> C[eyecite Citation Parser]
    B -- Synthetic: SCOTUS Court Check --> C
    C --> D[Gemini Trace Generator LLM / Template]
    C --> E[Gemini Relation Classifier]
    D --> F[(ChromaDB Vector Store)]
    E --> G[(NetworkX Graph DiGraph)]
    G --> H[terra_eeg_index.json]

    %% Phase 2 Reasoning
    Input[User Query] --> Cop{Traffic Cop Router}
    Cop -- EASY --> Direct[Direct LLM Path]
    Cop -- HARD --> Search[(ChromaDB Retrieval)]
    Search --> Traverse[BFS Graph Traversal depth=2]
    Traverse --> Grader{Smart Grader NLI}
    Grader -- Entails=True --> Generator[Final LLM Generator]
    Grader -- Entails=False --> Expand[Double Search Radius n_results+=2]
    Expand --> Search
    Expand -- Failed 2x --> Refusal[Safety Refusal Firewall]
    Direct --> Output[Final Answer]
    Generator --> Output